WEBVTT

00:00:00.770 --> 00:00:02.480
This isn't how it was supposed to be.

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:08.400
We were supposed to become happy.

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:15.820
This is all a lie. A reality like this.
A little sister like this.

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:18.080
Someone like me...

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:23.460
Should all disappear.

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:06.010
Sophie...

00:01:23.770 --> 00:01:27.310
That human named Martin Hennes...

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:44.580
Who would believe he
carried no inner darkness?

00:01:44.910 --> 00:01:47.620
It's a little unexpected.

00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:51.170
He has the brains
to make this project a reality.

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:54.130
As long as we have that, it is not a problem.

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:58.050
Well, that's true.

00:01:58.340 --> 00:02:01.760
No matter the circumstance,
we must protect the owner of the ring.

00:02:02.430 --> 00:02:06.730
We merely must continue our duties.

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:09.480
I know. I know.

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:14.440
To begin with, duty or not,
we can't go against the ring.

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:18.570
What does he plan to do?

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:26.080
Oh, really? That's wonderful.

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:40.760
You sure took your time...

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:44.510
...King.

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:34.800
How? Why?

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:38.250
Brother? Brother!

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:50.390
You surpassed my expectations,
Sophia Hennes.

00:04:52.390 --> 00:04:54.100
What are you talking about?

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:59.060
Your big brother was
very satisfied with your efforts.

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:05.030
This is... my fault...?

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:09.680
This is my fault...

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:14.000
So, you have come.

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:20.170
Golden Knight.

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:23.630
Sorry for making you wait.

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:33.520
Bastard.

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:45.780
Brother...

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:48.240
Sophie...

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:02.590
Sophie...

00:06:20.310 --> 00:06:22.410
Sophie...

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:45.500
This is bad.

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:47.760
Have a few more.

00:06:58.350 --> 00:06:59.690
Annoying!

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:05.480
Here we go!

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:22.290
There is no point in running.

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:47.780
What the hell is going on?!

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:01.960
So messed up.

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:04.570
So, this is King?

00:08:06.340 --> 00:08:11.470
Well, we're pretty messed
up ourselves, aren't we?

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:12.740
Queen.

00:08:19.430 --> 00:08:20.850
What is happening?

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:23.310
Sophie has made it out of the tower.

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:26.170
Seems Sword made it in time.

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:30.730
We need to evacuate any remaining people.

00:08:32.030 --> 00:08:32.820
Yes.

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:49.410
He's here.

00:08:57.260 --> 00:08:58.600
It's my fault.

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:05.780
It's my fault my brother became a Horror.

00:09:07.350 --> 00:09:11.190
You're wrong. It's not your fault.

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:14.240
So you shouldn't blame yourself.

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:26.330
You okay? Let's go!

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:54.530
Sophie. Don't leave my side.

00:10:49.370 --> 00:10:51.180
You've awoken, Zaruba?

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:53.840
At the worst time ever.

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:56.280
As long as you're not still half-asleep.

00:11:06.680 --> 00:11:11.320
No matter the era, they 
try to stand against me.

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:37.840
What's wrong?

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:38.630
Huh?

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:42.320
You look unusually down.

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:44.640
Sorry about that.

00:11:44.640 --> 00:11:46.310
Even your responses are boring.

00:11:47.720 --> 00:11:49.930
So, what's with that chassis of yours?

00:11:50.430 --> 00:11:53.900
It was something made 
in the Land of Guidance.

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:55.690
Gina?

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:56.860
That's right.

00:11:57.480 --> 00:11:59.700
Hm? What's wrong, Sophie?

00:12:00.190 --> 00:12:01.570
You've been really quiet.

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:03.200
What happened?

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:18.750
Sophie!

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:22.930
Thank goodness you're safe!

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:26.700
Sophie?

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:29.330
What's wrong?

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:35.190
Sword?

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:41.980
Sophie...

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:54.790
So, King's plan was to use
Sophie to take over Martin Hennes.

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:56.700
That's right.

00:12:58.290 --> 00:13:02.590
There is no need to involve
Sophie in this any longer.

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:05.930
Now we know why she was targeted.

00:13:06.590 --> 00:13:08.300
The only order remaining
from the Watchdog Center

00:13:08.800 --> 00:13:10.750
is the elimination of the Horrors.

00:13:15.690 --> 00:13:16.550
You're right.

00:14:02.110 --> 00:14:03.530
The time has finally come.

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:12.490
A notification?

00:14:12.490 --> 00:14:14.410
Huh? An app auto-started...

00:14:43.020 --> 00:14:46.110
My greatest desire
will finally come to fruition.

00:14:46.860 --> 00:14:48.610
My three blades, I command this upon you.

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:53.160
Destroy all who stand
against this new world.

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:03.090
Goodness.

00:15:03.090 --> 00:15:06.370
Looks like it's time for us to shine, Queen.

00:15:25.980 --> 00:15:27.040
This is...

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:28.440
What is it?

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:30.330
...ther.

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:33.480
Brother!

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:35.400
--Can you hear me?
--This voice...

00:15:37.240 --> 00:15:40.790
ELDO NET has been connected
to the world-wide network.

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:42.000
Lizzy!

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:45.880
The souls of people
are already being harvested.

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:50.800
They're being forced in,
even if the user doesn't want access!

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:51.760
What did you say?!

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:57.560
King will grow stronger
as he consumes more souls,

00:15:57.560 --> 00:15:59.550
spreading ELDO NET.

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:02.020
A terrible cycle.

00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:04.000
Is there a way to stop him?

00:16:04.610 --> 00:16:08.280
We can't stop him from consuming the souls.

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:12.950
However, the special storage unit
that houses the souls from ELDO NET...

00:16:14.620 --> 00:16:18.890
If you can access that, you may be
able to release them from the inside.

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:20.700
What do we have to do?

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:27.620
The person with administrator access
is the project manager Martin Hennes...

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:33.880
But there is one more person
who has the same privileges.

00:16:34.970 --> 00:16:36.240
It's Sophia Hennes.

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:52.700
Looks like you really like that spot there.

00:16:53.400 --> 00:16:56.160
Will something become clear
to you if you stay in that spot?

00:16:58.870 --> 00:17:00.160
Sorry.

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:02.120
Why are you apologizing?

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:04.170
I...

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:11.010
I only did what I could,
there is no need to apologize.

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:13.350
I...

00:17:14.510 --> 00:17:19.470
Souls all over the world are starting
to be absorbed by ELDO NET.

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:20.510
Huh?

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:21.890
It's King.

00:17:24.690 --> 00:17:29.750
He'll use the power he gets
from those souls to harvest more souls.

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:36.740
Sophie. It seems Martin Hennes
had given you administrator access.

00:17:36.740 --> 00:17:37.490
Huh?

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:43.510
Seems like we can release
the harvested souls using that access.

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:50.170
But Sword and the others
don't plan to take you with them.

00:17:51.050 --> 00:17:53.940
They're trying to do
something about it themselves.

00:17:54.630 --> 00:17:56.630
Goodness. You're all so hopeless.

00:18:07.480 --> 00:18:09.200
Hey, Sophie.

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:27.610
Looks like that's your will.

00:18:53.690 --> 00:18:56.440
Brother, I found an
infiltration device you can use!

00:18:56.650 --> 00:18:58.990
I see. What about the access?

00:18:59.660 --> 00:19:04.180
Sorry... I still haven't found
a way to access the storage unit.

00:19:05.080 --> 00:19:08.430
I see. Keep looking.

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:10.720
I understand.

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:13.510
Brother, be careful.

00:19:14.550 --> 00:19:19.300
Leave Sword to me.
I'll protect him until the end.

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:21.430
I'm depending on you.

00:19:22.050 --> 00:19:24.010
And you too, Zaruba.

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:32.080
Take me with you.

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:36.340
I don't know if I'll be of any help...

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:38.320
Sophie...

00:19:39.400 --> 00:19:43.360
But if there is still something I can do...

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:50.180
If you plan on becoming
food for them, don't come.

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:54.340
That's not it.

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:58.960
I can't undo what I've done.

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:01.930
But, if I can protect someone.

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:06.090
Just like you, Luke, and Sword...

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:10.240
I want to protect them!

00:20:43.550 --> 00:20:44.590
Let's go.

00:20:46.060 --> 00:20:46.920
Yeah!

00:21:04.480 --> 00:21:05.710
I'll let you owe me one.

00:21:06.370 --> 00:21:07.700
Make sure to pay me back.

00:21:09.300 --> 00:21:10.160
We good?

00:21:10.720 --> 00:21:14.290
Yeah. Let's go!

00:21:14.790 --> 00:21:16.170
Which gate do you want to use?

00:21:16.170 --> 00:21:17.880
Huh? Who are you?

00:21:17.880 --> 00:21:18.920
That's my little sister.

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:20.090
What?!

00:21:21.170 --> 00:21:22.210
Watch out!

00:21:30.430 --> 00:21:31.770
He's come for us.

00:21:31.770 --> 00:21:33.060
Go on ahead, Sword.

00:21:33.060 --> 00:21:34.270
Luke and I will take care of things here.

00:21:39.110 --> 00:21:40.650
There's no need to worry.

00:21:40.650 --> 00:21:43.030
I won't make the same mistake again.

00:22:04.590 --> 00:22:06.550
You bastards...!
